      "location": {
        "known": true,
        "value": "The Duelist Set pieces can be dropped as loot from the Duelist enemies located in Leyndell, Royal Capital .; There is an apparent Colosseum on a hill in the southeast area of the city that has two Duelists, one patrolling the path and one at the top. Both of these enemies have a chance to drop all three pieces.",
